Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢電影30週年紀念作品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這顆星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}連個像樣的生物都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起，布依金大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在這顆星球上也沒有發現他們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}繼續找
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}無論如何都要把他們找出來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那下個目標是哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，太陽系的第三顆行星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也就是叫做地球的那顆行星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}媽媽要你幫她去買東西啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，媽媽…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我現在很忙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快要趕不上玩海盜遊戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼海盜遊戲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像是跟胖虎他們先約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就用溫暖的眼神…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}守護他好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從學校放假之後就只知道玩耍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這也證明大雄很健康
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒什麼關係啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸，你又說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他都五年級了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還跟個小孩子一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是令人操心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小孩子就該有點孩子氣才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，我說的對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}既然這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那誰要替大雄去幫我買東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我跟小咪還要去約會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那爸爸你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我也和田中先生約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜託啦，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我這邊是非常重要的約會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜託啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很重要的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}兩塊油豆腐，四塊竹莢魚干
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:07.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}培根，雞蛋，還有爸爸的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有哆啦A夢的銅鑼燒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我最喜歡媽媽了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是在帛琉島拍的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}前天我還和表哥在那裡潛水哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胖虎，你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個破東西還真是難用耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛙鞋本來就應該是在水裡用的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嫌棄的話就快點還給我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，小夫你剛才說的帛琉夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你表哥的名字還真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是帛琉夫啦，我說的是帛琉島
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}像你這種小學五年級
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還在玩海盜遊戲的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼可能會瞭解這種事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是真的嗎，胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為大雄一直說他很想玩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:06:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你那個叫帛琉島的表哥怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是南太平洋上的一個島國
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到處可以看到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一望無際的清澈海水哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們在看什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快看，這張
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快讓我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這叫蝠鱝魚，又被稱作魔鬼魚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是小夫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被你發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你都不害怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一點都不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香也可以騎哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下次一起去騎吧，怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看還是不要好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哦，真的很好玩的說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是我表哥在愛琴海潛水的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拍的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是沉在海底的遺跡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要看，我也要看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還想要看更多的話就來我家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我都拍成影像了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好耶，那就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好期待哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走吧，一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄也要來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用勉強也沒關係哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不是還要忙著玩海盜遊戲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他是很忙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是胖虎他叫我出來玩海盜遊戲的耶　你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎麼可能會玩那種
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小孩子氣的海盜遊戲咧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有這個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找了老半天只找到這個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個連現在的幼稚園小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是我上幼稚園的時候在玩的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}果然還是個小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真像大雄的風格
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香妳…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被我弄扁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，還給你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄不來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他想來的話自己會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄都已經五年級了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}應該可以自己做決定了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我忘了，他還在唸幼稚園啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們不要這樣說大雄啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:27.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太欺負人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行，我得要用…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最溫暖的眼神來守護著他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢：大雄的人魚大海戰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}片頭曲「藍色夢想」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:11.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}有個充滿希望圓滾滾的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:15.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}藍色的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:19.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}總是帶領我們乘著夢的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:21.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}自由的飛翔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}竹蜻蜓！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:26.88,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}穿過每個時空越過宇宙兩端
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:30.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}多不可思議的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:32.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}只要推開紅色的門
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:36.82,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}所有心願就可以實現啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.82,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}任意門！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:42.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}長大後就忘了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:46.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}曾經擁有過的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:50.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}讓我們來手牽手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:54.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}一起出發去冒險啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:58.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}夏啦啦啦啦　讓我們手拉著手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:02.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}轉著圈圈哼唱著快樂的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}哆啦A夢用你的口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:09.15,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}變化出未來的幸福吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:13.93,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}夏啦啦啦啦　讓我們手拉著手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:17.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}飛向天空享受著吹來的風
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}哆啦A夢是你的出現
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.77,0:10:27.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}讓世界充滿希望和夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，我也好想去潛水哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大…大雄，戴上這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虛構海水觸覺眼鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不是想去潛水嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，要去哪裡潛水
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去帛琉，還是夏威夷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在這裡，在這間屋子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊，快點，戴上眼鏡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虛構海水觸覺眼鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺好像在騙人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你…你在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點停下來，媽媽會罵人的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你摘下眼鏡來看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:47.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是一臺虛構水面模擬器水泵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虛構水面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:49.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為了研究及預測
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}地球海平面上升所引發的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而開發出來的假海水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}假海水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:12:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有戴眼鏡的人是不會看到水的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且也不會弄濕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好神奇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要把這些水存起來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊，就能把這一帶變成海底
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣就能享受潛水的樂趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也讓我試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用這臺水泵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要花多久時間才能存夠水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大概要到今天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可撐不了那麼久啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奇怪，還在動耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算你不管它還是照樣會動的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那你怎麼不早點說，真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有其它要準備的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等等我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要運送魚過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還不懂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要拍出讓小夫目瞪口呆的照片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太感謝你了，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}魚兒最愛吃的魚餌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，把這個魚餌灑在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}撒了以後會怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}魚兒們就會聚集過來吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說魚兒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從天上飛到這裡來吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最後再用這個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}活動釣魚池
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}調整好刻度之後
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}變成海洋了，這裡會有魚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:47.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這可是跟真的大海連在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下來…虛構海水連帶氣體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}魚兒們只要接觸了這種氣體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.09,0:13:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能夠在模擬海水中生存了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，再來等到晚上就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真令人期待
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比對不一致
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:15:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又是一把普通的破爛劍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}破壞它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金大人，實在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一定會賭上我的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找出人魚族
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}並且將寶劍得手的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}話說回來，托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:22.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你以前有沒有看過
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水量如此豐沛的行星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從來沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這真是一顆美麗的行星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對那些人魚來說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這裡是再適合不過的藏身之處
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}無論用什麼方法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都要把他們找出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，時間差不多囉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.83,0:15:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼嘛，都沒有看到有積水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你戴上這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，快點穿上這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:15:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}旱鴨子專用蛙鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穿上它就會游泳了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都這麼晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸今天還真晚耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，不能碰那個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟…糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你怎麼還沒睡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.95,0:16:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點睡覺了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，快想想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還…還差一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:50.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嚇死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛才那是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你把水泵的安全裝置解除了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當你戴著虛構海水觸覺眼鏡的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是絕對不能去碰那個按鈕的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哇塞，街道都淹沒在海底了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，那裡是虛構水面哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}整個城鎮都變成大海了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不止整個城鎮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全世界都變這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你在看什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛…剛才有一條人魚跳出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚，這怎麼可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我剛才明明就看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要不要拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來，笑一個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.52,0:18:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}過去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鯊…鯊魚，有鯊魚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，你先冷靜一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}街道上怎麼會有鯊魚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我剛剛就看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在香煙店的轉角那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呼啦一下就游了過去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呼啦一下的是在說你自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是不是喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我那時候正跟田中先生聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不然會被你老婆罵的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:19:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我真的看到了，親眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，快點回去吧，路上小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鯊魚真的在空中游動耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你看，還有沙丁魚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看來，真的是我喝多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你剛剛看到的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是人魚，難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鯊魚…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得快點捉起來送回海裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸怎麼可能會看得到鯊魚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他又沒戴眼鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你把眼鏡摘掉看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然看不到虛構水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還是照樣能夠看得到魚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為這眼鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是專門用來看虛構水的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.29,0:19:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸沒有戴眼鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:19:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}卻能看得到魚兒是因為
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虛構海水連帶氣體的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}魚兒在虛構水中也能夠生存了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我們分兩邊去找鯊魚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我眼花了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找不到耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鯊魚這傢伙跑去哪裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你後面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:15.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}回家音樂盒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.45,0:21:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不怕你呢，有本事就過來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要聽了這個音樂盒的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不管在哪裡都會想要立刻回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣所有的魚兒都回到海裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們現在也該回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，我想睡覺了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}晚安，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像快要下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:25.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，我要開始沖洗照片囉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.83,0:22:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我的媽呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.77,0:22:46.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.87,0:22:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看…看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難道是昨天晚上的鯊魚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鯊魚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看到的明明是女孩子耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.13,0:23:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好可愛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.07,0:23:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我剛才明明有看到魚尾鰭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.41,0:23:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好帥氣唷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好可愛的妹妹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她是你新認識的朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.66,0:23:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，快點請她進來坐坐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她好像很渴的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.67,0:23:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}聽不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是不是還想再喝一杯果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}翻譯蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出太陽了，那就來洗衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼東西，難道是一種河豚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}河豚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思，我是貓
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是貓
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.07,0:24:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你要笑到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.97,0:24:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.94,0:24:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫做大雄，這位是…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.41,0:24:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是叫做哆啦A夢的貓
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是…蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.12,0:24:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才沒有騙人咧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我媽媽聽人家說的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.56,0:24:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天晚上街上出現了鯊魚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.86,0:24:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胡說，又不是在海裡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.70,0:24:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在街上怎麼可能會有鯊魚嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.33,0:24:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我聽說看到鯊魚的人是小杉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.11,0:25:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼可能啦，又不是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.04,0:25:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}叫我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.88,0:25:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我又怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.89,0:25:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.86,0:25:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，這個女孩子是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我來介紹一下，這是蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我現在正在帶她參觀附近的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.13,0:25:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這位是…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.06,0:25:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄的知心朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.27,0:25:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫胖虎，本名叫剛田武
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.70,0:25:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.94,0:25:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫靜香，初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.21,0:25:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，妳是從哪裡來的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她從哪裡來的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼嘛，不過就是架飛機
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.19,0:25:46.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在天上…游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.55,0:25:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}游泳，這個說法還真有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，妳不會沒有見過飛機吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼可能，都什麼時代了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可見她從小住在鄉下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.57,0:26:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說話的口氣太讓人討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又很失禮
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.51,0:26:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好啦！\N快點帶蘇菲亞到街上去逛一逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.91,0:26:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}往那裡看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.04,0:26:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在陰天的時候就能看到好多雲
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.51,0:26:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有，從這地方下去的話
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以看到好多…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.78,0:26:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沿著這條路一直走
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.69,0:26:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奇怪，蘇菲亞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.80,0:26:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，危險
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.87,0:26:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太危險啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.17,0:26:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的，太不像話了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.24,0:26:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.91,0:26:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，要遵守交通規則啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.45,0:26:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼，這是竹蜻蜓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.88,0:26:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有這個就能在天上游泳了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.29,0:26:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.40,0:27:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.17,0:27:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.51,0:27:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我居然能在天上游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.33,0:27:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.06,0:27:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼辦…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.97,0:27:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.37,0:27:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜託，我想回到水裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.47,0:27:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，快點帶她到我家去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.68,0:27:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.94,0:27:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}任意門
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.28,0:27:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來，往這邊走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:56.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:28:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我現在就讓妳泡澡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家都出去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.30,0:28:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.60,0:28:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄你也出去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個…我忘記收回任意門了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.64,0:28:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.04,0:28:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.96,0:28:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原來蘇菲亞也喜歡泡澡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.06,0:28:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.63,0:28:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你不覺得很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.07,0:28:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她居然連飛機和紅綠燈
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.67,0:28:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都沒有看過
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.24,0:28:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞她…該不會是河童吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.11,0:28:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你在胡說些什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是她突然想泡澡也很怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.42,0:28:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以你才說她是河童嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:28:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.82,0:28:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.89,0:29:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚存在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.29,0:29:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一下河童，現在又是人魚
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.22,0:29:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我第一次看到蘇菲亞的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.63,0:29:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像在她的腳上看到魚尾鰭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.20,0:29:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像人魚一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是這個啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.61,0:29:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哆啦美打來的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂，妳好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.11,0:29:24.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂，是哥哥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.35,0:29:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}關於人魚我調查過了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你現在在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.41,0:29:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就在靜香的房間裡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.48,0:29:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}各位，我正好請哆啦美來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.13,0:29:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.89,0:29:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒…沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.56,0:29:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}關於人魚的事情，妳知道些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.13,0:29:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就交給最新型的時空電話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.40,0:29:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你先畫一下人魚的圖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.91,0:29:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}畫人魚的圖
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.78,0:29:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最古老的人魚傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.58,0:29:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出現在西元前3千年
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也就是5千年前的上古時代
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.55,0:30:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼早以前就有了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.75,0:30:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}畫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.66,0:30:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所謂的人魚總是被人們描繪成
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.83,0:30:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上半身是人，下半身是魚的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.43,0:30:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像大雄畫的圖一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.87,0:30:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，你們看看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.28,0:30:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這…這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.31,0:30:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是魚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.34,0:30:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，是人類吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.78,0:30:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是巴比倫神話中所記載
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.85,0:30:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}名為奧安尼斯的水神
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.42,0:30:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}據說他從海裡現身
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.62,0:30:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}向住在陸地的人們傳授文明
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.19,0:30:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以說是人魚的始祖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.06,0:30:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奧安尼斯作為保佑航海安全的神
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}受到人們的崇拜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.37,0:30:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}除此之外
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.01,0:30:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}據說希臘神話中
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.57,0:30:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出現的海神波賽頓
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.98,0:31:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他兒子特里登也是人魚的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.75,0:31:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚的傳說世界上到處都有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.55,0:31:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是不是也有一種說法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.45,0:31:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有人把海裡游的海牛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.09,0:31:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誤認為是人魚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.73,0:31:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看，這就是海牛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.93,0:31:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼，這一點也不像人魚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.77,0:31:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有人把哺乳中的海牛的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.23,0:31:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看成了人魚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看起來有像嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，衣服我放在這裡哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.28,0:31:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.51,0:31:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這套洋裝
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.51,0:31:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想先洗一下會比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.12,0:31:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行，不要亂碰
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.22,0:31:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那等我有新消息會再通知你們
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.63,0:31:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝妳，哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.76,0:31:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:31:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香她…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}變成人魚了…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.38,0:32:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼，妳是從海底過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.35,0:32:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對，這套專用的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.55,0:32:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以讓我們在大海裡
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.19,0:32:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自由自在的游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.19,0:32:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真對不起，嚇到妳了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.79,0:32:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一開始有嚇到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.43,0:32:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過能夠變成人魚也滿好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.93,0:32:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是嗎，太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.97,0:32:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為虛構海水連帶氣體的作用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.17,0:32:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓她迷失在模擬海水中了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這麼說，妳的家鄉在海底囉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.88,0:32:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.91,0:32:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}據說我們人魚族的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.85,0:32:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在5千年前來到了地球定居
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.55,0:32:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}並且建造了一座很大的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.15,0:32:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開始在海底的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說來到了地球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.12,0:32:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼說的話是外星人囉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.59,0:32:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且5千年前的說法
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和人魚的傳說是一致的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.76,0:32:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊，也許就是人們在海上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.36,0:32:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看到了蘇菲亞的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.17,0:33:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以世界各地才會有人魚的傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.17,0:33:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是，怎麼會想要來地球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.24,0:33:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}據說我們人魚族
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.08,0:33:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最早原本和平的生活在
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}與地球非常相似的一個星球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.65,0:33:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}藍水星上
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.09,0:33:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.43,0:33:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大海受到了汙染
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.10,0:33:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那顆星球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.00,0:33:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}變得不再適合生物居住了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.14,0:33:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}於是你們就到地球來了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其實我們人魚族
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.94,0:33:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是被禁止到陸地上來的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.64,0:33:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是我很想親眼看看故鄉的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.78,0:33:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以才冒險從海底來到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我們現在就一起去看星星吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.19,0:33:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.63,0:34:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}星星只有晚上才看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.56,0:34:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.66,0:34:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以只要到夜裡去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.10,0:34:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說的對耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.17,0:34:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}地球上總有處於夜晚的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要到那裡去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.91,0:34:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想不到大雄滿機零的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.91,0:34:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，要去哪裡比較好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.21,0:34:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在是晚上的國家很多耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.45,0:34:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，藍水星在什麼方位
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.25,0:34:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起，我也不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.72,0:34:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是根據傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.76,0:34:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}藍水星與4個月亮連一線
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會構成一個五角形哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果是五角形
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.70,0:34:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有一個叫御夫座的星座很有名
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.97,0:34:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五角形嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.54,0:34:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}餃子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.67,0:34:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是御夫座啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.37,0:34:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正我們就到那裡去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，御夫座是冬季的星座
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.01,0:34:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}日本現在根本看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.25,0:34:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那南半球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.88,0:34:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在正要入冬不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.78,0:34:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.12,0:34:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我們就往黑夜出發囉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.26,0:35:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好冷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.53,0:35:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當然冷了，這裡已經是冬天了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.33,0:35:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太壯觀了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺就像星星正往我們靠近呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.97,0:35:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多麼漂亮的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.14,0:35:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞故鄉的星星會是哪一顆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.72,0:35:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這些星星當中一定會有藍水星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.73,0:35:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過啊，小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.27,0:35:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪一個是餃子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.27,0:35:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是那個五角形的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是御夫座啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.61,0:35:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯…就是那個
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.11,0:35:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是那顆嗎，還是這顆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.94,0:35:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.21,0:35:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也搞不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.41,0:35:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.98,0:35:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜託，這裡有這麼多的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.25,0:35:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根本搞不清楚到底是哪一顆嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.05,0:36:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}倒是你們不冷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.56,0:36:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點回去了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.79,0:36:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.39,0:36:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站住，你別想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.26,0:36:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不要追過來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.63,0:36:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.67,0:36:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可不饒你，你給我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.14,0:36:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.10,0:36:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你到底要我怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.97,0:36:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫，你快點把餃子…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.18,0:36:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是御夫座啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正都怪你找不到那顆星星啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.61,0:36:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞她有多傷心，你知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對於蘇菲亞來說
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.25,0:36:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那可是非常重要的星星呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.32,0:36:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以你一定要認真的對待
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算是這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.46,0:36:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人家還是冷得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.39,0:36:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是男子漢就要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.36,0:36:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對，要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.83,0:36:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}忍耐啊，要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.17,0:36:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人家就是忍耐不了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.50,0:36:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝你們大家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.34,0:36:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，沒關係啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.84,0:36:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳不是要找故鄉的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我已經親眼看到
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.91,0:36:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很多美麗的星星啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.78,0:36:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我現在覺得非常的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.82,0:37:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫，謝謝你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.05,0:37:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.39,0:37:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也該回去海底的宮殿了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.06,0:37:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.76,0:37:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，妳住在宮殿裡
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.06,0:37:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.86,0:37:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼說妳是女王陛下囉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，我還沒有正式繼承王位呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以現在還是人魚族的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.67,0:37:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.44,0:37:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有找到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.34,0:37:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有，都沒有看到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.12,0:37:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}萬一被地球人發現的話
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.72,0:37:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.85,0:37:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還沒有找到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.49,0:37:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到處都找遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.09,0:37:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快點分頭去找
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.39,0:37:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海底的宮殿一定很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.43,0:37:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，我也好想去看看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.23,0:37:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是一座在海底的宮殿耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.00,0:37:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難道你們不想去看看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.20,0:37:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，我也好想去看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.27,0:37:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.31,0:37:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個…我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:37:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}求求你啦，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.98,0:38:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，我們可以去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.75,0:38:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒問題啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.68,0:38:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我會好好招待大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.32,0:38:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，就這樣決定
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.35,0:38:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出發了，到海底宮殿去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.55,0:38:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.39,0:38:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們這些傢伙，不要得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說什麼，發現人魚族了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.06,0:38:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.27,0:38:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}無論從什麼角度看都是人魚族
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.40,0:38:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}絕對不會錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.84,0:38:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.57,0:38:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幹得好，繼續監視
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.17,0:38:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.08,0:38:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從前我的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從人魚族那裡奪走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}傳說中的盔甲
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.09,0:38:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下來只要找出人魚之劍就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.32,0:38:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要得到了這個盔甲和傳說之劍
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}整個宇宙就是我的囊中之物了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.94,0:39:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把奇妙鏡放大之後
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.85,0:39:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}顏色就這樣調整好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.42,0:39:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，請妳站在鏡子前面
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.46,0:39:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.63,0:39:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼回事，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.26,0:39:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的，你們別來搗亂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.53,0:39:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.20,0:39:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}做好一套了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.14,0:39:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果要去海底的話
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.64,0:39:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有蘇菲亞的人魚套裝
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.08,0:39:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}應該會比較方便
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.35,0:39:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.11,0:39:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}應該說是魔法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.58,0:39:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有什麼事情
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.52,0:39:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哆啦A夢辦不到的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.65,0:39:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然常常會出差錯就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.79,0:39:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.12,0:39:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.86,0:39:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點換上衣服，準備要出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.00,0:40:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}適應燈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.07,0:40:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣不管在什麼地方都不怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.64,0:40:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海底也沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.94,0:40:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要在24小時之內
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.95,0:40:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆…哆啦A夢，差不多可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.72,0:40:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.55,0:40:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我們出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.78,0:41:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個是防水繩索
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.25,0:41:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要進入繩子圈的中間
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.15,0:41:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水就不會靠近了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.13,0:42:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是讓人驚訝耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.57,0:42:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢就像是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.10,0:42:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚族傳說中的海神瑪娜提婭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.70,0:42:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}傳說中的海神
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.40,0:42:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瑪娜提婭
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.64,0:42:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊，那是我奶奶告訴我的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.61,0:42:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當人魚族面臨危險的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.01,0:42:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他都會使用人魚之劍來幫助我們
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.85,0:42:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.72,0:42:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}據說我們人魚族的祖先們
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.12,0:42:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}世世代代都盡心盡力的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}守護著那把人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.36,0:42:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是現在卻不知去向了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.29,0:42:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}弄丟了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是5千年前流傳下來的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.73,0:42:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有人說
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.70,0:42:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那只不過是一個傳說而已
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.20,0:42:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}傳說之劍，好棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.81,0:42:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}聽起來真是浪漫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.87,0:42:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.81,0:42:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.61,0:42:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們一起來找人魚之劍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.58,0:42:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說什麼，哪有這種…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.68,0:42:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個你也能辦到嗎，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.02,0:42:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這…這個
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.68,0:42:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒問題啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.15,0:43:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}坐在你面前的可是哆啦提婭
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.26,0:43:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比海神瑪娜提婭還要更厲害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.13,0:43:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}與其說是海神
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.96,0:43:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不如說是海貍貓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.90,0:43:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一點也沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.16,0:43:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不是什麼貍貓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.80,0:43:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吧，既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.14,0:43:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.30,0:43:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個也不是，不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.91,0:43:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.91,0:43:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.31,0:43:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}尋寶紙，還有顯示暖爐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來，蘇菲亞，妳拿著這個
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.65,0:43:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.78,0:43:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這又是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.92,0:43:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在尋找寶物的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}它會告訴我們一些線索哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.89,0:43:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果說人魚之劍真的存在的話
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.39,0:43:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼重要線索
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.53,0:43:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定會顯示出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.76,0:43:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.13,0:43:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}試試看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.31,0:43:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}顯示出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.51,0:44:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當得到皇家真心祈禱之時
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.08,0:44:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光將會聚集
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.55,0:44:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而願望也得以實現
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.52,0:44:06.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這又是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.89,0:44:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要解開這個謎題
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.12,0:44:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能找到寶劍了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.69,0:44:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上面所說的皇家
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.89,0:44:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會不會就是蘇菲亞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.23,0:44:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.67,0:44:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個是…是藍水星的古文字
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.30,0:44:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上面寫的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.44,0:44:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這些文字實在太古老了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.41,0:44:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.88,0:44:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，照這麼看來
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.41,0:44:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚之劍確實是存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.95,0:44:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.68,0:44:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要能夠解開這個謎題
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.12,0:44:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就一定可以找得到
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.79,0:44:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光，謎題
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果是奶奶的話
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.38,0:45:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也許她會知道些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.36,0:45:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.53,0:45:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安，蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.10,0:45:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安，靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.67,0:45:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個皇冠真的好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.90,0:45:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個是我們人魚族皇家的標誌
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.97,0:45:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳是說皇家
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.14,0:45:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的好令人憧憬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.65,0:45:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香，妳想要戴看看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.58,0:45:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.68,0:45:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓妳體驗一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.12,0:45:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當公主是什麼樣的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.95,0:45:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝妳，蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.73,0:45:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個我幫妳拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.20,0:45:52.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.11,0:46:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感覺好棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.52,0:46:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.39,0:46:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.09,0:46:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，快點起床了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.16,0:46:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要準備出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.80,0:46:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點起床，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.74,0:46:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好壯觀哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.14,0:46:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們的宮殿就在這下面了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.84,0:46:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.91,0:46:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.15,0:46:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.35,0:46:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們潛入海底
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.62,0:46:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是應該會越來越暗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.59,0:46:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.12,0:46:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是為什麼這麼亮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.49,0:46:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}實際上是在慢慢的變暗啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.83,0:46:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為有了適應燈的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.46,0:46:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}才會讓你覺得沒有什麼變化
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.00,0:46:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算潛到一萬公尺深的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.07,0:47:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也跟在太陽下面一樣哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.88,0:47:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}作戰開始
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.89,0:47:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.29,0:47:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓我休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.53,0:47:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是沒用耶，還游不到一個小時
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.97,0:47:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你還真是厚臉皮耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.60,0:47:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再摸魚的話就丟下你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.54,0:47:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要是碰到章魚妖怪我們可不管哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.64,0:47:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}少說這種風涼話啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.78,0:47:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說不定就在這附近呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.28,0:47:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.98,0:47:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.66,0:47:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.92,0:47:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也…也許是虎饅魚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.90,0:48:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且是超大隻的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.10,0:48:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用你說我也知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.53,0:48:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.41,0:48:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.41,0:48:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}追…追過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.99,0:48:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}各位，快來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.42,0:48:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點，躲到裡面去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.92,0:48:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆…哆啦A夢，救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.10,0:48:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.23,0:48:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別…別吃我，我一點也不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.00,0:48:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.24,0:48:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}振作一點，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.51,0:48:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到裡面去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.91,0:48:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來…來了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.85,0:48:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.85,0:48:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.88,0:48:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.82,0:48:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水壓炮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.12,0:49:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.81,0:49:22.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.99,0:49:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪裡來的硬梆梆藍色河豚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.36,0:49:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不是河豚，是貓…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.00,0:49:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，快點給我抓起來
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.37,0:49:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.93,0:50:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}變小了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.43,0:50:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.86,0:50:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個…不覺得很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.83,0:50:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.77,0:50:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這條虎饅魚好像是被誰操控著
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.64,0:50:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說的是指誰
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.27,0:50:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎麼會知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.24,0:50:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遇到這麼可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.71,0:50:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你還敢說不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.14,0:50:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.84,0:50:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快住手啦，胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.45,0:50:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.08,0:50:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.05,0:50:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.32,0:50:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.65,0:50:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，妳平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.29,0:50:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原來是蘇菲亞的朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.53,0:50:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.53,0:50:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我有一種非常不好的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.33,0:50:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你現在馬上去把這件事調查清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.83,0:50:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.93,0:50:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.70,0:50:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我認為還是請公主您先回宮殿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.50,0:50:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}跟麥地那博士談一談
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.40,0:50:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣會比較妥當
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.14,0:50:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.54,0:50:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼就請您趕緊回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.84,0:50:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.54,0:50:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}溫蒂妮陛下她也很擔心您呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.35,0:50:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.45,0:51:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過我跟哆啦A夢他們…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.12,0:51:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.85,0:51:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們幾位由我負責接送回去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.52,0:51:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}總之公主請您先回宮殿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.82,0:51:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也有一種不好的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的名字叫小哈利對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.17,0:51:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是大雄，請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.97,0:51:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.34,0:51:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你要去哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.84,0:51:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這傢伙態度好差勁
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.87,0:51:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要以綁架犯的罪名
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.41,0:51:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}逮捕你們幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.88,0:51:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}綁架
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.88,0:51:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說我們
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.91,0:51:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}綁…綁架誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.15,0:51:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是公主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.38,0:51:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}綁架蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.59,0:51:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說什麼蠢話
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.16,0:51:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好擠啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.63,0:51:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給我帶回去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.93,0:51:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.34,0:52:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎…怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.51,0:53:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}麥地那博士
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.45,0:53:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}無論是寫在這裡的謎語
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.95,0:53:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還是突然攻擊我們的巨大虎饅魚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.82,0:53:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我總覺得好像要發生什麼大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.92,0:53:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}的確是很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.36,0:53:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果能與這張紙的主人見面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.53,0:53:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}聽聽他的意見就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.53,0:53:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利應該會帶他過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.56,0:53:25.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.70,0:53:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我請小哈利過來問問吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.27,0:53:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.14,0:53:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.84,0:53:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.28,0:53:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，快想想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.28,0:53:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行啦，我的手伸不到口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.35,0:53:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這群膽敢綁架我們公主的無禮傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.55,0:53:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}絕不能原諒他們
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.96,0:53:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有…有什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.92,0:53:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這…這是巨齒鯊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.06,0:53:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.86,0:53:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是生活在
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.66,0:53:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}200萬年前的巨型鯊魚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.93,0:53:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們應該早就滅絕了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.43,0:54:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.77,0:54:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們會變成他的魚飼料嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.17,0:54:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}魚…魚飼料
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.74,0:54:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們肯定要被吃掉了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.11,0:54:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這怎麼可以，快桃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.44,0:54:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說怎麼桃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.15,0:54:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們兩個冷靜一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.35,0:54:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一點也不好吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.99,0:54:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.29,0:54:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.49,0:54:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}馬上停止這愚蠢的舉動
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.26,0:54:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是，這些傢伙把公主您…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.13,0:54:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點住手
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.89,0:54:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.30,0:54:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是胖虎，我是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.14,0:54:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一點也不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.84,0:54:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.14,0:54:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.21,0:54:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一點也不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.91,0:54:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是胖虎，我是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.65,0:54:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼噪音啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.15,0:54:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.98,0:54:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點把哆啦A夢他們都放出來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.22,0:54:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.05,0:54:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你還不懂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.15,0:54:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個音波肯定是他們的悲鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.16,0:54:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}媽…媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.53,0:54:57.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胖虎，別唱了啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.86,0:55:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我寧可給巨齒鯊吃掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.30,0:55:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}各位，真對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.10,0:55:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.47,0:55:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，我們都嚇死了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.14,0:55:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是因為胖虎的歌聲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.81,0:55:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.11,0:55:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對了，請問靜香她人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.51,0:55:16.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.35,0:55:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你幹嘛突然大叫
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.55,0:55:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說不定靜香還在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.66,0:55:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說的那裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.89,0:55:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是那個洞穴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.73,0:55:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.96,0:55:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利，我問你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.80,0:55:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你該不會把靜香一個人丟在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.00,0:55:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自己就跑回來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.00,0:55:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了，我們得趕緊去找靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.27,0:55:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.74,0:55:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.94,0:55:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}溫蒂妮陛下請您過去找她
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.28,0:55:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶找我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.48,0:55:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，陛下有令
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.88,0:55:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也請您把客人一起帶過去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.85,0:55:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼，我們也要過去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.15,0:55:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是靜香她…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.16,0:56:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們就跟蘇菲亞一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.76,0:56:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}尋找靜香的事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.13,0:56:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就交給我跟小夫來處理
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.46,0:56:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.30,0:56:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們一定可以找到靜香的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.90,0:56:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當然囉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.67,0:56:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也需要這位隊長大人的幫忙才行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.64,0:56:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.23,0:56:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起，我先接個電話
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.80,0:56:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哆啦美嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.81,0:56:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.34,0:56:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我又發現了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.28,0:56:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}關於人魚的有趣情報了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.14,0:56:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在不是閒聊的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.01,0:56:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}晚點再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.25,0:56:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.55,0:56:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}掛了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.69,0:57:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥也真是的，每次都這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.40,0:57:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以我就跟你說了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.00,0:57:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.57,0:57:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒想到海底
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.47,0:57:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟然有這麼漂亮的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.47,0:57:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊，真讓人吃驚耶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.31,0:57:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.44,0:57:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還要把你們介紹給奶奶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.24,0:57:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}情況到底怎麼樣了啦，胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.28,0:57:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看樣子不在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.88,0:57:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你看…怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.75,0:57:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到底該怎麼辦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.25,0:57:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香…靜香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.72,0:57:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他的抗壓性很差吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.73,0:57:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.76,0:57:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香妳在哪裡，妳在哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.63,0:57:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他其實是一個好傢伙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.60,0:57:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不如我們先來看看這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.80,0:57:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.70,0:57:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.44,0:57:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.24,0:57:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.48,0:57:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.64,0:57:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們找到了這個
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.58,0:57:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.91,0:57:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.98,0:58:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們快點把這個東西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.38,0:58:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}送回麥地那博士的研究室去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.75,0:58:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這些黑色液體也一起帶回去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.72,0:58:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.72,0:58:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}隊長大人，到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.26,0:58:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我認為攻擊大家的巨大虎饅魚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.83,0:58:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是受到那些壞蛋操控的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.90,0:58:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那些壞蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.37,0:58:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且我想
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.37,0:58:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香恐怕也是被那夥人給抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.37,0:58:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.27,0:58:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.51,0:58:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說抓走靜香的那些壞蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.31,0:58:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到底是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.40,0:58:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.47,0:58:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個人就是蘇菲亞的…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.98,0:59:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，好像有點可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.21,0:59:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，太沒有禮貌了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.92,0:59:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.72,0:59:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳遲早要繼承王位
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.09,0:59:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成為這個國家的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.66,0:59:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}應該多注意自己的言行舉止
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.09,0:59:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.43,0:59:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一旦我當上了女王
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.96,0:59:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就再也沒有自由的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.36,0:59:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正因為如此
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.33,0:59:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才要趁著現在瞭解更多的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.27,0:59:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給我住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.67,0:59:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，妳先坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.64,0:59:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.57,0:59:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好壯觀哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.31,0:59:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.94,0:59:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.44,0:59:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.41,0:59:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們人魚族全體居民的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.88,0:59:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全都寄託在妳身上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.25,0:59:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我希望國家可以永遠和平
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.25,0:59:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人民也能夠得到幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.82,0:59:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這才是我們皇家後代的最大職責
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.93,0:59:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我把所有的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.40,0:59:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全都寄託在妳身上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.13,0:59:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正因為如此
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.37,0:59:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不允許妳再繼續任性下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.50,0:59:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳能夠理解吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.74,1:00:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.91,1:00:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.18,1:00:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然我不太瞭解，不過…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.25,1:00:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要當公主還真不簡單呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.92,1:00:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，我到現在才知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.72,1:00:17.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，我想無論如何
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.89,1:00:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.62,1:00:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定會成為一個了不起的女王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.73,1:00:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為她是多麼的帥氣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.43,1:00:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也很活潑，又值得信賴
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.40,1:00:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且，還那麼漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我能當蘇菲亞的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.01,1:00:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.71,1:00:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個問題可不是那麼簡單的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.14,1:00:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.65,1:00:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.75,1:00:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就讓我們當永遠的好朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.20,1:01:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}溫蒂妮陛下，我回來了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.27,1:01:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}咦！那靜香呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.17,1:01:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.01,1:01:08.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們沒有找到
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.58,1:01:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.64,1:01:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，我們找到了一個很奇怪的東西喔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.81,1:01:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有黑色的液體
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.22,1:01:15.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.42,1:01:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看來博士的推斷得到了證實
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.92,1:01:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是嗎…那繼續分析
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.16,1:01:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.06,1:01:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定是那些壞蛋做的好事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.76,1:01:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說的那些壞蛋他們到底是誰啦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.06,1:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們就是他們嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.66,1:01:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正跟地球人又沒有關係
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.97,1:01:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.87,1:01:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胖虎，你冷靜一點
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.87,1:01:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是這個傢伙從剛剛就一直…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.87,1:01:40.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起，我會跟小哈利好好說的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.74,1:01:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這怎麼好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.38,1:01:43.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.45,1:01:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你就不能跟他們好好相處嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.48,1:01:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們是地球人耶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.22,1:01:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}地球人自以為統治了全世界
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.95,1:01:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}貪得無厭的奪取地球資源
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.19,1:01:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.79,1:01:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還不斷的汙染這一片美麗的大海
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.42,1:01:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼能跟他們好好的相處呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.69,1:02:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄他們絕不是那種人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.13,1:02:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們是很珍惜這個地球的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.36,1:02:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定也會保護我們
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.40,1:02:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}無論如何我願意相信他們
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.24,1:02:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你懂嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.21,1:02:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個殘骸
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.71,1:02:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是用地球上的金屬製成的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.21,1:02:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個黑色液體
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.25,1:02:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也不是地球上的產物
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.32,1:02:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從以上的情況分析，結論是…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.32,1:02:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難道說怪魚族來到了地球
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.92,1:02:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.19,1:02:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼會有這種事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.06,1:02:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}女王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.03,1:02:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳剛才說的怪魚族是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.53,1:02:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們應該知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.90,1:02:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們人魚族是從藍水星來的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.43,1:02:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.37,1:02:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在遙遠的過去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.47,1:02:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們人魚族和怪魚族
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.04,1:02:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在藍水星上和平的共處
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.95,1:02:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.45,1:02:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以海洋資源為食物的怪魚族
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.69,1:02:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不斷的擴張自己的勢力
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.85,1:03:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}突然之間霸占了整個藍水星
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.89,1:03:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}倖存下來的人們
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.83,1:03:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}桃進了深山繼續戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.23,1:03:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是面對敵人壓倒性的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還是無能為力
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.64,1:03:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}迫不得已我們桃離了藍水星
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.47,1:03:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}經過漫長的太空旅行，終於…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.98,1:03:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來到了地球上
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.78,1:03:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這麼說靜香真的被抓走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.72,1:03:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}恐怕只能這麼想了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.66,1:03:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快說，人魚之劍在什麼地方
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.90,1:03:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}少裝傻
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.54,1:03:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定是被你們人魚族給藏起來了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.54,1:03:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我真的不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.08,1:03:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚族的公主竟然說不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.62,1:03:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主，我才不是公主
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.39,1:04:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳頭上的那個皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.02,1:04:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是皇家的證明
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.22,1:04:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，妳的皇冠呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.26,1:04:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.23,1:04:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我借給靜香了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.17,1:04:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這麼說靜香她…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.13,1:04:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.50,1:04:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.60,1:04:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個皇冠是我們皇家的標誌
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.94,1:04:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大概是把她誤認為蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.91,1:04:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}才把她抓走的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.41,1:04:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.31,1:04:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，我們要趕緊去救靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.55,1:04:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.35,1:04:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個怪魚族為什麼要抓蘇菲亞呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.89,1:04:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}依我的推測看來
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.82,1:04:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}答案就藏在這裡面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.79,1:04:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.59,1:04:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怪魚族他們
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.43,1:04:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是為了想要得到人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.17,1:04:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.77,1:04:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個傢伙，你還敢做壞事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.91,1:04:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.67,1:04:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你這是幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.77,1:04:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們這些地球人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.81,1:04:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼會知道人魚之劍的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.18,1:04:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，是妳嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.58,1:04:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.58,1:05:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們只是想要幫助我們
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.28,1:05:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}來尋找傳說的那把人魚之劍的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.95,1:05:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思，博士，那個…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.96,1:05:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不起，失培一下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.93,1:05:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.26,1:05:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.97,1:05:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家好，我是哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.34,1:05:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這下子又冒出個黃色河豚來了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.14,1:05:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個小刺魨是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.14,1:05:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.14,1:05:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是沒禮貌
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.51,1:05:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.71,1:05:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳怎麼從口袋跑來
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.62,1:05:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.72,1:05:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，你又忘了帶備用口袋囉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.66,1:05:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳是通過口袋過來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.96,1:05:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我很聰明吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.69,1:05:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那妳來這裡做什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.73,1:05:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，你老是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.66,1:05:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真有意思，真是太有意思了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.27,1:05:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個…博士
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.23,1:05:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能不能讓我見識一下那個口袋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.74,1:05:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請看這個啦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.25,1:06:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.26,1:06:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原來公主的名字叫靜香啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.96,1:06:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看起來就是壞蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.46,1:06:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是你這個壞傢伙綁架了靜香嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.30,1:06:23.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}馬上把她送回來
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.94,1:06:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在就給我還來
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.97,1:06:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.00,1:06:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就是怪魚族之王布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.81,1:06:32.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們的公主就在我的手裡
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.91,1:06:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其實她…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.15,1:06:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.88,1:06:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快把寶劍交出來
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.68,1:06:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}馬上把人魚之劍交給我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.72,1:06:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不然的話…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.19,1:06:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.33,1:06:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可惡，你搞什麼鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.46,1:06:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好難受
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.87,1:06:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是免費奉送的，也嚐嚐這個吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.11,1:07:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想要救公主的命
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.71,1:07:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就乖乖的把寶劍交出來
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.71,1:07:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.92,1:07:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行啦，為什麼是公主您…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.49,1:07:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不要阻止我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.02,1:07:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要跟怪魚族宣告
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.56,1:07:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才是真正的公主
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.29,1:07:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼靜香就可以被放出來了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.29,1:07:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰要是反對就回去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.76,1:07:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.13,1:07:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.63,1:07:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.60,1:07:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當得到皇家真心祈禱之時
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.37,1:07:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光將會聚集
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.88,1:07:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而願望也得以實現
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.65,1:07:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所謂的五色之光指的是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.96,1:07:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果不帶著人魚之劍去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.90,1:07:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}恐怕是沒有辦法的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.20,1:07:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼，人魚之劍是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.93,1:08:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓你們久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.50,1:08:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}寶劍怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.40,1:08:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.34,1:08:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚之劍到底長什麼樣子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.21,1:08:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰也沒有親眼看過
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.28,1:08:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過據說是像珍珠一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.51,1:08:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}閃耀著光芒的寶劍
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.55,1:08:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就是這個了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.02,1:08:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}速成珍珠貝
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.25,1:08:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這的確是能夠做出珍珠來
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.35,1:08:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過我們想要的是劍啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.79,1:08:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是說嘛，不是劍的話就沒用啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.70,1:08:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼…要是把這個變成珍珠呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.23,1:08:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那種東西怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.67,1:08:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這種假貨一眼就看穿了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.57,1:08:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，這也許是個好主意哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.74,1:08:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，不是說誰也沒看過嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.21,1:08:43.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說的也是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.05,1:08:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，那個借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.06,1:08:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.29,1:08:59.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.70,1:09:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，放進去囉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.40,1:09:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.84,1:09:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快桃
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.41,1:09:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.32,1:09:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你叫我們快桃，就是因為這個
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，大功告成
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.94,1:09:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，幹得好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.97,1:09:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想不到大雄真有兩把刷子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.94,1:09:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，我們大家一起去救靜香吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.48,1:09:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.79,1:09:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下來就交給我們吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.72,1:09:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請你借一艘潛水艇給我們
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.06,1:10:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，我也要一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.16,1:10:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.96,1:10:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳將來還要領導這個國家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.86,1:10:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}領導你們人魚族
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.46,1:10:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}絕對不能夠亂來
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.03,1:10:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果連靜香一個人都保護不了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.27,1:10:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼我又怎麼保護這個國家呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.50,1:10:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在就是該冒點風險才是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.94,1:10:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，都不要再說了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.44,1:10:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快去救我們的朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.01,1:10:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.85,1:10:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}痛死了，不過確實了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.21,1:10:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.12,1:10:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.45,1:10:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利，你又要來阻止我嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.59,1:10:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是的，我有個請求
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.66,1:10:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請讓我跟你們一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.43,1:10:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我小哈利為了保護公主
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.36,1:10:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算赴湯蹈火也在所不辭
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.00,1:10:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你又在逞強了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.30,1:10:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一個人努力
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.50,1:10:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}的確是一件非常值得肯定的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.10,1:10:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過與其自己單打獨鬥
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.31,1:10:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還不如大家一起同心協力比較好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.51,1:10:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.38,1:10:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.11,1:10:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們大家都是伙伴，一起努力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.05,1:10:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.35,1:10:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖然你是一個讓人討厭的小刺魨
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.82,1:11:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是你不在就沒有人跟我吵架了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.22,1:11:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那多沒意思啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.16,1:11:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請多多指教哦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.79,1:11:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.23,1:11:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全都要靠你了，小小隊長大人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.07,1:11:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.53,1:11:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，出發囉
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.18,1:11:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}由大雄跟哆啦A夢擔任先鋒隊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.85,1:11:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其他人就留在這裡待命
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.72,1:11:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.49,1:11:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胸口悶悶的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.19,1:11:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且還覺得有一點頭暈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.40,1:11:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這麼說起來我好像也…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.67,1:11:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我從剛才就已經…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.60,1:11:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.57,1:11:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.54,1:11:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.77,1:11:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是適應燈的效果正在慢慢的消失
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.71,1:11:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.48,1:12:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，胖虎跟小夫就拜託妳了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.72,1:12:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，靜香有危險
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.32,1:12:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只剩下30分鐘了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.72,1:12:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不會吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.89,1:12:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好難受
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.16,1:12:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香公主
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.16,1:12:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.87,1:12:20.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主，我們來接妳了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.60,1:12:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼都是一些小孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.57,1:12:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞧不起人嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.37,1:12:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.78,1:12:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對付你們這些人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.18,1:12:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我托拉吉斯就綽綽有餘了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.68,1:12:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}廢話少說，人魚之劍帶來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.35,1:12:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就裝在這個裡面
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.18,1:12:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，拿過來
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.45,1:12:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行，要用公主來交換
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.86,1:12:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太麻煩了，乾脆動手吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.33,1:12:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等寶劍到手以後再說
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.36,1:12:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，還有多少時間
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.93,1:12:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.93,1:12:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟了，只剩下4分鐘了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.23,1:12:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}時間不夠了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.47,1:12:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是在這種情況下也不能出手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.54,1:12:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.04,1:12:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從這些文字上分析
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.28,1:13:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚之劍的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.01,1:13:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}似乎與公主有很深的關連
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.85,1:13:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原本寶劍還有盔甲
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.32,1:13:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以及公主的皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.92,1:13:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在5千年前就是某人的寶物
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.19,1:13:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沙卡那，下一頁
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.06,1:13:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.69,1:13:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要將這三樣寶物湊齊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.83,1:13:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就會產生巨大的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.06,1:13:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}足以控制了整個世界
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.30,1:13:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而掌握這一切關鍵的人正是公主
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.40,1:13:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞她…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.74,1:13:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.84,1:13:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就在那裡進行交換，去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.18,1:13:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那邊的藍色河豚
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.65,1:13:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不是…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.85,1:13:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把劍拿過來
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.82,1:13:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼河豚呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.26,1:13:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還剩兩分鐘
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.63,1:13:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.87,1:13:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為什麼停住了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.10,1:13:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先讓我看看那把寶劍
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.27,1:13:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先把公主放了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.84,1:14:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要先看寶劍
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.27,1:14:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還剩1分半
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.74,1:14:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你想反抗我嗎，該死的藍色河豚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.04,1:14:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是貓
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.71,1:14:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.32,1:14:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.15,1:14:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還剩1分鐘
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.82,1:14:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.72,1:14:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了，不好了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.49,1:14:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.19,1:14:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們看好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.33,1:14:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.17,1:14:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼，把靜香…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.77,1:14:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點把公主放出來
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.17,1:14:32.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還剩30秒
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.91,1:14:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，公主還給你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.18,1:14:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.78,1:14:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還剩20秒
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.43,1:14:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還剩12秒
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.03,1:14:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，拿好這個
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.50,1:14:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.63,1:15:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.97,1:15:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快用適應燈
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.94,1:15:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已經可以了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.21,1:15:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.48,1:15:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.02,1:15:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.15,1:15:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.50,1:15:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的好險哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.80,1:15:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那些傢伙該怎麼處理呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.57,1:15:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要寶劍到手他們就沒用了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.97,1:15:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}隨便你們吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.47,1:15:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.91,1:15:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼樣，靜香，妳還好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.54,1:15:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有受傷嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.84,1:15:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我沒事
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.01,1:15:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，哆啦A夢，謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.28,1:15:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.65,1:15:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.88,1:15:49.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}射擊…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.29,1:15:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}危險
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.89,1:15:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.36,1:15:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.23,1:15:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到這邊來
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.06,1:16:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.43,1:16:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.03,1:16:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.14,1:16:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不快點去救他的話
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.01,1:16:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.85,1:16:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太慢了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.39,1:16:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香，趁現在
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.59,1:16:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.86,1:16:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.89,1:16:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點走啊，靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.93,1:16:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.04,1:16:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我生氣了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.45,1:16:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個臭小子，就像在跳舞呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.32,1:16:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}繼續跳啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.82,1:16:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.82,1:16:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.19,1:17:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水壓炮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.13,1:17:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒用的東西
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.60,1:17:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，閃遠一點
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.94,1:17:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那傢伙想要幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.04,1:17:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}射擊…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.71,1:17:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}避敵斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.05,1:17:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.82,1:17:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美好厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.35,1:17:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那不是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.26,1:17:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.63,1:17:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥…哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.84,1:17:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點跑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.18,1:17:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這就是人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.25,1:18:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.12,1:18:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟敢拿這種假貨來敷衍我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.92,1:18:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}實在是對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.83,1:18:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}聽好了，傳說中…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.23,1:18:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚之劍上面和那個盔甲一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.30,1:18:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都有鑲著紅寶石
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.47,1:18:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當年
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.67,1:18:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們的祖先在侵略人魚族之時
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.41,1:18:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出現了一位身穿盔甲
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.48,1:18:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}手持人魚之劍的戰士
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.58,1:18:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}起身對抗我們怪魚族
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.15,1:18:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個戰士身上穿的東西還有一件
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.05,1:18:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是公主的皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.99,1:18:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根據古代文獻的記載
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.56,1:18:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}皇冠，盔甲，還有人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.06,1:18:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要擁有這三樣寶物
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.93,1:18:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就會成為人魚族的神
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.60,1:18:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也就是瑪娜提婭所選出來的戰士
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.40,1:18:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被選為神的戰士
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.27,1:18:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最終將成為人魚族的領袖
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.08,1:18:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}帶領人魚族的人民對抗怪魚族
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.65,1:19:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而那位戰士的名字就叫做蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.36,1:19:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一樣的名字耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.16,1:19:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下來又會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.73,1:19:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最後因為寡不敵眾
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚族漸漸被逼到走投無路
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.14,1:19:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}終於有一天不得不離開藍水星
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.81,1:19:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在這同時盔甲被怪魚族奪走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.01,1:19:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而人魚之劍也下落不明
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.48,1:19:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在我們人魚族只剩下一樣東西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.88,1:19:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是公主頭上的那頂皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.89,1:19:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且能夠引出皇冠力量的人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.72,1:19:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是擁有相同名字的公主
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.17,1:19:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根據傳說
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}戰士身上所穿的盔甲和寶劍
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.70,1:19:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會自動回應主人的召喚
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.34,1:19:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:19:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小的在
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.94,1:20:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}寶劍就在這附近
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.68,1:20:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}聽好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.81,1:20:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這一次一定要把人魚族給消滅掉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.38,1:20:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.52,1:20:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且一定要把人魚之劍弄到手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.02,1:20:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快去，發動總攻擊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.66,1:20:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.57,1:20:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}陛下，怪魚族開始進攻了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.51,1:20:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒辦法了，立刻準備反擊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.35,1:20:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.51,1:20:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利，我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.28,1:20:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，公主
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.65,1:20:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.65,1:20:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.52,1:20:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就全權託付給妳處理了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.66,1:20:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳自己來做最正確的判斷吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.62,1:20:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.29,1:20:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這場戰爭會是什麼結果
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.13,1:20:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也無法預料
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.56,1:20:54.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但一定是一場嚴苛的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.33,1:20:55.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如此重責大任
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.97,1:20:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在卻要由妳一個人來承擔
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.14,1:21:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請妳原諒奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.77,1:21:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶以前對妳總是太過嚴厲了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.01,1:21:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是，請妳千萬不要忘記
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.92,1:21:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶比任何人都愛妳
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.49,1:21:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.82,1:21:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也一樣，我也是最愛奶奶了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.53,1:21:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.10,1:21:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，我也最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.50,1:21:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也一樣，哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.77,1:21:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我開玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.88,1:21:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我們一定要打敗怪魚族
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.66,1:21:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}射擊…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.96,1:21:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}避敵…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.56,1:21:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.17,1:22:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}臭小子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.97,1:22:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛才竟然敢讓我丟人現眼
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.57,1:22:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我刺
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.74,1:22:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看招
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.04,1:22:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.29,1:22:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.89,1:22:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}撤退，快點撤退啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.69,1:22:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}邪惡之心會使劍變得汙濁
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.36,1:22:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}善良之心會使劍變得清澈
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.10,1:22:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是刻在皇冠上的另一個謎語
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.20,1:22:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我相信公主
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.54,1:22:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}您一定有辦法解開這個謎語的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.94,1:22:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}報告情況
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.04,1:22:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我方損害非常巨大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.68,1:22:42.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}目前戰鬥力已經減半
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.04,1:22:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼，先暫時撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.91,1:22:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是公主…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.98,1:22:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們的神，瑪娜提婭啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.72,1:22:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請聆聽我的祈禱
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.25,1:22:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不能再讓那些無辜的士兵們受傷了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.12,1:22:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}無論如何，請您保護他們吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.66,1:23:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當得到皇家真心祈禱之時
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.07,1:23:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光將會聚集
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.17,1:23:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而願望也得以實現
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.35,1:23:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就是人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.79,1:23:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一點也沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.26,1:23:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}傳說現在變成事實了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.81,1:23:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把劍是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.31,1:23:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這就是人魚之劍嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.35,1:23:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.58,1:23:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.42,1:23:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.42,1:23:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是你可以使用的東西
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.02,1:23:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}終於…終於落在我的手裡了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.92,1:24:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看招
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.73,1:24:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.16,1:24:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.27,1:24:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看著，這就是傳說之劍的威力
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.01,1:24:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.28,1:24:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.85,1:24:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不…不好了，大家快點桃命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.19,1:24:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}膽敢反抗我的人絕不饒恕
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.42,1:24:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個怪物是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.79,1:24:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.90,1:24:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本大爺
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.90,1:24:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}即將成為全宇宙的主宰者了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.64,1:24:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.74,1:24:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原來是用防水繩索建造的基地
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.78,1:24:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的，釣魚手套豪華版
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.25,1:24:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}媽啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.22,1:25:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家一定要撐下去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.85,1:25:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，上鉤了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.06,1:25:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把人魚族的軍隊通通趕盡殺絕
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.47,1:25:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.60,1:25:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把劍的威力是無法預測的強大
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.74,1:25:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣下去，恐怕大家…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.97,1:25:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}神啊，保護我們人魚族吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.05,1:25:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一切都要結束了嗎，是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.29,1:25:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.66,1:25:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定要想辦法把寶劍奪回來
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.19,1:25:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家同心協力才走到這一步
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.20,1:25:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}絕不能輕言放棄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.43,1:25:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.93,1:25:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.67,1:25:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對，沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.41,1:26:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢，接下來該怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.15,1:26:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.62,1:26:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能不能把布依金叫到這裡來呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.49,1:26:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.69,1:26:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有道理耶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.82,1:26:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有水
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.59,1:26:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚之劍也就沒有辦法使用了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.06,1:26:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是這麼狹小的地方不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.96,1:26:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有了，就用虛構海水連帶氣體…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.50,1:26:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一次就拿出來了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.47,1:26:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你打算怎麼用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.07,1:26:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要朝布依金噴一下就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.17,1:26:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.81,1:26:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想用這個道具得先用虛構水
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.18,1:26:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水泵的開關一直都是開著的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.58,1:26:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什麼，真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.18,1:26:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.18,1:26:34.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}既然這樣的話，我去拿過來
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.75,1:26:36.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.85,1:26:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要怎麼把氣體噴到布依金身上
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.29,1:26:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我有一個很好的辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.66,1:26:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就用這個
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.19,1:26:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這又是什麼秘密道具
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.86,1:26:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是普通的衝浪板
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.36,1:26:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唉呦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.87,1:26:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}衝啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.24,1:26:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.97,1:26:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.38,1:27:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}賞你一個屁
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.41,1:27:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可惡
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.76,1:27:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快點去那座小島
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.43,1:27:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.67,1:27:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不…不好了，蘇…蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.44,1:27:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞，快點，往這邊跑
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.48,1:27:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.68,1:27:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她還沒到
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.82,1:27:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在這之前…帶上這個
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.42,1:27:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.39,1:27:48.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是虛構海水觸覺眼鏡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.57,1:27:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們這些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.40,1:27:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到此為止了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.34,1:28:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金，快投降吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.14,1:28:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自以為聰明的地球人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.24,1:28:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們就當公主的培葬吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.84,1:28:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可不允許
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.45,1:28:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}經過了5千年的漫長等待
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.38,1:28:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}終於能夠消滅人魚族了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.95,1:28:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.33,1:28:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這…這是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.83,1:28:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成功了…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.64,1:28:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為那是虛構水啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.50,1:28:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.54,1:28:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟然有這種蠢事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.64,1:28:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要不是真正的水
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.04,1:28:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把人魚之劍就無法使用了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.68,1:28:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把神聖的劍你根本就不配使用
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.95,1:28:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，快把人魚之劍還給我們
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.19,1:28:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰敢妨礙本大爺
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.69,1:28:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就讓他粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.76,1:28:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.53,1:28:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個小妞
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.87,1:29:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞公主
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.84,1:29:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站住
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.34,1:29:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人魚族啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.01,1:29:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟敢單獨跟我對抗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.14,1:29:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算妳勇氣可嘉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.21,1:29:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但也到此為止
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.81,1:29:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要有了這把劍
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.42,1:29:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本大爺注定是要統治全宇宙的\N哥哥！走開
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.79,1:29:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.92,1:29:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.63,1:29:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}秘劍電光丸
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.90,1:29:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虛構水面
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.17,1:29:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}模擬器水泵
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.87,1:29:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.44,1:29:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快點往上飛
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.31,1:29:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，把開關關掉
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.57,1:30:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放我出去…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.70,1:30:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜託，把我從這裡放出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.07,1:30:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}乖乖投降吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.91,1:30:13.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們的國王布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.78,1:30:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已經被我們俘虜了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.74,1:30:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胡說
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.15,1:30:18.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}趕快投降吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.45,1:30:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可惡
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.38,1:30:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們怎麼可能會輸給人魚族
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.02,1:30:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們是無敵的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.27,1:30:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.22,1:30:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.09,1:30:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大海
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.04,1:31:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厲害，好厲害哦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.48,1:31:23.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.42,1:31:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.08,1:31:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.79,1:31:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.63,1:31:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為大海實在是太美了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.53,1:31:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太美了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.67,1:31:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.47,1:31:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想這應該才是人魚之劍
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.74,1:31:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真正的力量對不對
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.87,1:31:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.08,1:31:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}總有一天
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.24,1:31:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們一定會帶著這把劍
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.84,1:31:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}回到故鄉藍水星去的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.35,1:31:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但那裡因為怪魚族的汙染
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.29,1:32:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}現在是一個只有汙水的星球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.65,1:32:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是無論如何那也是我們的故鄉
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.93,1:32:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}絕不能輕言放棄
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.96,1:32:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這不是大雄這一次
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.60,1:32:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓我們瞭解的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.23,1:32:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要使用這把劍
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.60,1:32:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}讓受到汙染的海水變回清澈
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.74,1:32:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}使藍水星恢復美麗的容貌
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.61,1:32:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是我們人魚族被賦予的使命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.65,1:32:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒錯吧，小哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.62,1:32:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的，公主
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.85,1:32:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能夠讓我遇到你們真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.32,1:32:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.07,1:32:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好難受
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.98,1:32:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快…快想辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.31,1:32:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.99,1:33:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主又更加成長了，真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.53,1:33:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，看來該讓她繼承王位了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.03,1:33:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.97,1:33:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}光榮屬於…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.37,1:33:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞女王
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.58,1:33:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼了，靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.25,1:33:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天晚上我沒有回家
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.08,1:33:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會被媽媽罵死的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.12,1:33:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.52,1:33:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼辦啦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.02,1:33:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼是最好能夠回到昨天吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.33,1:33:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對不對
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.36,1:33:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是這麼回事
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.03,1:33:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.50,1:33:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太危險了，大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.27,1:33:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.90,1:33:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不曉得能不能再見到蘇菲亞
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.67,1:33:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過，只有這點我敢保證
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.88,1:34:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞他們的傳說
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.48,1:34:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以後還是會繼續流傳下去的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.81,1:34:03.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定會
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.05,1:34:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蘇菲亞真的好可愛耶
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.22,1:34:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.32,1:34:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}靜香，對不起啦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.10,1:34:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.03,1:34:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他去打棒球了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.50,1:34:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.53,1:34:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸，去幫我買點東西
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.30,1:34:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，拜託妳了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.20,1:34:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸，最近你老是這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.94,1:34:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}兩塊油豆腐，四塊竹莢魚干
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.21,1:34:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}培根，雞蛋，還有爸爸的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.61,1:34:38.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有哆啦美的菠蘿麵包
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.88,1:34:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我最喜歡媽媽了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.75,1:34:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我來…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.23,1:34:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.99,1:34:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}臭大雄，你在幹什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.50,1:34:58.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}電影片尾曲「就這樣吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.00,1:35:02.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}回憶走過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.77,1:35:05.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}刻劃著時間最美的時候
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.48,1:35:07.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}有你的笑容陪伴著
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.38,1:35:10.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}我一個人也不寂寞
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.42,1:35:14.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}世界的兩端作同一個夢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.52,1:35:17.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}持續著我們約定的承諾
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.59,1:35:19.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}期待重逢能牽著手
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:22.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}穿越那美麗的時空
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.96,1:35:26.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}別害怕我會陪伴著你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.73,1:35:30.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}找尋那世界每個幸福的入口
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.00,1:35:34.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}面對困難準備好出發
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.84,1:35:37.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}手牽手飛吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.38,1:35:40.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}就這樣吧　就這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.45,1:35:43.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}一起向未來出發
